{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"cecea8f9d72d5aaa","type":"file","file":"仓库管理系统/02_实施记录/日记/UI模块/2026-07-28 Day12 ProductTableModel与列表页.md","x":-227,"y":-108,"width":587,"height":900,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"e7d25b8119a8b49f","type":"text","text":"# ProductTableModel与ProductService查询的对接\n## 在点击\"查询\"按钮后\n```C++\n// 简化代码如下\n// 创建筛选器\nProductFilter filter; \nfilter.keyword = keywordEdit->text(); \nfilter.categoryId = ...;\nfilter.active = ...;\n// 创建请求\nPageRequest request;\nrequest.page = currentPage_;\nrequest.pageSize = pageSize_;\n// 调用ProductService进行获取分页数据,UI回调函数进行设置分页数据\nproductService_->listProducts(\n    filter,\n    request,\n    this,\n    [this](const ProductPageResult& result) {\n        if (!result.success) {\n            // 显示错误状态\n            return;\n        }\n        productTableModel_->setPage(result.page); // 设置分页数据\n        // 更新分页 UI\n        // ......\n    });\n```\n\n## UI页面需要知道的状态\n```C++\nenum class PageState {\n    Idle, // 空闲\n    Loading, // 查询开始\n    Ready, // 查询成功(有数据)\n    Empty, // 查询成功(无数据)\n    Error // 出现错误\n};\n```","x":-1120,"y":-108,"width":747,"height":900,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"e96c8f961656224e","type":"text","text":"# ProductTableModel作用\n1. 保存当前页面的分页数据DTO\n2. 对ProductListItemDto数据进行构建模型\n3. 控制视图的刷新边界\n4. 使UI通过ProductService进行查询分页数据","x":480,"y":-108,"width":311,"height":226,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"2415d47f8c980bc6","type":"text","text":"# 连续点击按钮的异步问题\n\n## 异步结果乱序:\n\t如果用户连续点击两次按钮,第一次查询的A,第二次查询的B,但是如果不做处理,可能会出现用户最后搜的B但是UI会显示A的情况\n## 解决方法:\n\t在每个查询中添加一个递增的序号用于区分,UI回调的时候进行检查,只接收最后一次的查询结果:\n```C++ \nif(seq != requestSeq)return; // 如果当前的序列号不是最后的序列号就直接返回\n```","x":466,"y":373,"width":374,"height":419,"color":"1"}
	],
